{"number":86,"nameArabic":"الطارق","nameTransliterated":"At-Tariq","nameTranslated":"The Nightcommer","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":17,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"86:1","textAr":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","transliteration":"Waalssamai waalttariqi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"By the sky and the night comer"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"قسم ہے آسمان کی اور رات کو نمودار ہونے والے کی"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"86:2","textAr":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma alttariqu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And what can make you know what is the night comer"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تم کیا جانو کہ وہ رات کو نمودار ہونے والا کیا ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"86:3","textAr":"ٱلنَّجۡمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","transliteration":"Alnnajmu alththaqibu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"It is the piercing star"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"چمکتا ہوا تارا"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"86:4","textAr":"إِن كُلُّ نَفۡسٖ لَّمَّا عَلَيۡهَا حَافِظٞ","transliteration":"In kullu nafsin lamma AAalayha hafithun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کوئی جان ایسی نہیں ہے جس کے اوپر کوئی نگہبان نہ ہو"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"86:5","textAr":"فَلۡيَنظُرِ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","transliteration":"Falyanthuri alinsanu mimma khuliqa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So let man observe from what he was created"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر ذرا انسان یہی دیکھ لے کہ وہ کس چیز سے پیدا کیا گیا ہے"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"86:6","textAr":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٖ دَافِقٖ","transliteration":"Khuliqa min main dafiqin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"He was created from a fluid, ejected"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ایک اچھلنے والے پانی سے پیدا کیا گیا ہے"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"86:7","textAr":"يَخۡرُجُ مِنۢ بَيۡنِ ٱلصُّلۡبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","transliteration":"Yakhruju min bayni alssulbi waalttaraibi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو پیٹھ اور سینے کی ہڈیوں کے درمیان سے نکلتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"86:8","textAr":"إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجۡعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٞ","transliteration":"Innahu AAala rajAAihi laqadirun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, Allah, to return him [to life], is Able"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یقیناً وہ (خالق) اُسے دوبارہ پیدا کرنے پر قادر ہے"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"86:9","textAr":"يَوۡمَ تُبۡلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","transliteration":"Yawma tubla alssarairu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جس روز پوشیدہ اسرار کی جانچ پڑتال ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"86:10","textAr":"فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٖ وَلَا نَاصِرٖ","transliteration":"Fama lahu min quwwatin wala nasirin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then man will have no power or any helper"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس وقت انسان کے پاس نہ خود اپنا کوئی زور ہوگا اور نہ کوئی اس کی مدد کرنے والا ہوگا"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"86:11","textAr":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجۡعِ","transliteration":"Waalssamai thati alrrajAAi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"By the sky which returns [rain]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"قسم ہے بارش برسانے والے آسمان کی"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"86:12","textAr":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدۡعِ","transliteration":"Waalardi thati alssadAAi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [by] the earth which cracks open"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور (نباتات اگتے وقت) پھٹ جانے والی زمین کی"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"86:13","textAr":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوۡلٞ فَصۡلٞ","transliteration":"Innahu laqawlun faslun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, the Qur'an is a decisive statement"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ ایک جچی تلی بات ہے"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"86:14","textAr":"وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلۡهَزۡلِ","transliteration":"Wama huwa bialhazli","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And it is not amusement"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہنسی مذاق نہیں ہے"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"86:15","textAr":"إِنَّهُمۡ يَكِيدُونَ كَيۡدٗا","transliteration":"Innahum yakeedoona kaydan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, they are planning a plan"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ لوگ چالیں چل رہے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"86:16","textAr":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيۡدٗا","transliteration":"Waakeedu kaydan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But I am planning a plan"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور میں بھی ایک چال چل رہا ہوں"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"86:17","textAr":"فَمَهِّلِ ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ أَمۡهِلۡهُمۡ رُوَيۡدَۢا","transliteration":"Famahhili alkafireena amhilhum ruwaydan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پس چھوڑ دو اے نبیؐ، اِن کافروں کو اک ذرا کی ذرا اِن کے حال پر چھوڑ دو"}]}]}